#: eda46e08ef2e47b5a9020c94b89674ec
msgid "For Copter, build the firmware as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-radix2hd.rst:226
#: 90383f798f3f4b6dbbc594850a3488f4
msgid "other vehicles can be built, but the RADIX2HD is targeted primarily for copter applications. Then use the firmware packer script to create the firmware file that can be used with the BrainFPV bootloader:"
